==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Chief Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[Chief Peng]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn as bosses after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Strategy 1 ([[Cheese]])'''===
{{Lineup
|Crazed Cat
|Crazed Tank Cat
|Crazed Axe Cat
|Crazed Gross Cat
|Manic Lion Cat
|Maglev Cat|30
|Awakened Bahamut Cat|30
}}

'''Battle:''' At the beginning, spawn a [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] and a Maglev Cat. Maglev Cat should kill the Chief Peng. Then spawn Awakened Bahamut and keep on spawning Manic Lion Cats. You should be able to destroy the base before Dark Emperor Santa spawns.

